                                "sense_id": "c3cccbbf-6a3f-3aca-bb37-e1204786ec1b",
                                "text": "We have previously shown that treating rats with the reversible goitrogen 6-propyl-2-thiouracil (PTU) from birth to Day 25 increases testis size and sperm production in adulthood by up to 80% and 140%, respectively."
